Tips for Maintaining Your IP CCTV System
To keep your surveillance system working effectively:
•	Clean camera lenses periodically to remove dust and dirt.
•	Check that cameras are recording and footage can be retrieved.
•	Test night vision and image quality regularly.
•	Update camera firmware and recording software when appropriate.
•	Use strong, unique passwords and restrict access to authorized users.
•	Review storage capacity and recording retention settings.
•	Check cabling, network connections, and backup power where installed.
Regular maintenance helps identify problems before they affect security coverage.
